MK61-VFAT-SESSION 1
# A durable SYNCHRONIZE CACHE followed by a clean eject.
OPEN CLEAN SESSION_OPENED
WRITE_ACCEPTED DIRTY WRITE_TRACKED
SYNC_REQUEST VALIDATING SYNC_QUEUED
SERVICE COMMITTING COMMIT_STARTED
COMMIT_OK CLEAN SYNC_SUCCEEDED
CLOSE_REQUEST CLOSING FINALIZE_STARTED
FINALIZE_OK CLOSED CLOSE_SUCCEEDED
